{{Passive skill box|Kineticism}}

'''Kineticism''' is a cluster jewel-only [[keystone passive skill]] that causes [[attack]] [[projectile]]s to always inflict [[Bleed]]ing and [[Maim]], as well as [[Knockback|Knocking Back]] enemies, at the cost of being unable to [[pierce]], [[fork]], or [[chain]].

==Mechanics==

While this skill makes attack projectiles always apply a knockback effect, it will not override the [[modifier:ImmuneToKnockback|Immune to Knockback modifier]] found on some enemies such as [[The Shaper]] or [[Sirus, Awakener of Worlds]].

